      <p class="eyebrow">About Brooke Reports</p>
      <h2>I'm Brookie. I learned this the expensive way.</h2>
      <p>Twenty years of professional judgment didn't stop me from spending more than ten thousand dollars in rooms designed to make it happen. I'd already studied my way out of one high-demand system. I walked into the next one anyway, because it was wearing a lanyard instead of a robe.</p>
      <p>Not to make you cynical. Not to prove everything is manipulation. Not to turn every sales page into a crime scene. The goal's simpler than that: to help you see what's happening before you decide what to do. I catch these on myself first. That isn't humility, it's method.</p>
